tion Customer Identity &amp;amp; Access Management Auth0 ↗ Okta Customer Identity Identity Governance &amp;amp; Administration Lifecycle Management Identity Governance Integrations Okta Integration Network Secure Identity Integrations Cross App Access Free Trial Pricing Release Overview Product Training Platforms Okta Secure all of your identities within an identity security fabric. Auth0 Ship amazing experiences with enterprise-grade customer identity. Free trial Contact us Back Solutions Okta is the neutral, powerful, and extensible platform that puts identity at the heart of your stack. Free Trial Pricing Release Overview Explore All Solutions By Identity Type Workforce Identity Customer Identity ↗ External Identities AI Agent Identities Non-Human Identities Personal Identities By Industry Public Sector Financial Services Healthcare Manufacturing Retail Travel &amp;amp; Hospitality Technology Non-Profit Energy Free Trial Pricing Release Overview Product Training Customer Success Stories Box enforces zero standing privileges with Okta Identity Governance. See full story Free trial Contact us Back Resources Webinars Blog Newsroom Customer Stories Identity 101 Events Explore all resources Get Support Support Center Overview Knowledge Base ↗ Product Hubs ↗ Visit support center ↗ Customer Success Success Plans Professional Services Product Training Product Certification Partners See all offerings Community Questions Forum ↗ Discussion Groups ↗ Community Blogs ↗ Okta Ideas ↗ Join Okta Community ↗ Free trial Contact us Back Developers Okta and Auth0 deliver flexible, secure access. Build fast with our extensible platforms for customers, workforce, and non-human identities. Free Trial Pricing Release Overview Product Training Okta Platform Okta Integration Network Developer Center ↗ Product Releases Product Documentation ↗ Community ↗ Okta Platform Status ↗ Auth0 Platform Auth0 Marketplace ↗ Developer Center ↗ Community ↗ Knowledge Base ↗ Auth0 Status ↗ Free Trial Pricing Release Overview Product Training Release Overview Explore our quarterly product Release Overview updates. See the latest announcements Free trial Contact us Back Company Our platforms secure all types of identity from AI agents to your customers, employees, and partners. Contact Us About Okta About Us Leadership Our Customers Newsroom Investors ↗ Okta Ventures Careers &amp;amp; community Careers Talent, Connection, &amp;amp; Community Values &amp;amp; Impact Responsibility Okta for Good Trust ↗ Accessibility Secure Identity Commitment Contact Us Discover our latest stories Free trial Contact us Okta + Privacy We believe privacy is an important topic for everyone and is especially critical when it comes to protecting the most sensitive information available today: your identity. Okta customers own their data Our business is built on secure, safe connections between people and technology – not monetizing customer data. We do not sell customer data – any and all data uploaded into the Okta service by or on behalf of a customer – and we never will. Okta is built for security and privacy Every product at Okta is designed with privacy and security at the forefront. Okta leverages a Zero Trust approach to access, which focuses on ensuring users have access to only the information and services they need to do their work at the right time, and no more. Okta also uses a multi-layer encryption architecture to protect data at rest and over the wire, including users&amp;#39; access to Okta and their applications, how the tenant data and encryption keys are segregated and managed, and how access to all infrastructure is managed and monitored. Okta enables building with privacy We aim to enable “privacy-by-design” for anyone building software with identity. Strong privacy should be built into every customer experience, and Okta strives to help developers build robust identity protections and security best practices into their software. Section titles are for impactful copy moments When we use data to improve the Okta service or provide better experiences for our customers, we do so while protecting our customers’ data and maintaining users’ privacy, and we are committed to being transparent about that use. For example, today we use aggregated and anonymized metadata about customers’ use of the Okta service to provide the Okta service and industry insights back to our customers in two ways: Businesses @ Work Okta’s Businesses &amp;#64; Work report provides customers and industry partners with general, anonymized information about the most popular and fastest growing apps in the Okta Integration Network, helping them make informed decisions on software investments and tools to boost productivity in the workplace. ThreatInsight We use anonymized threat intelligence from across Okta’s platform to strengthen security for customers and prevent bad actors from compromising users and organizations. Learn more Okta and the GDPR Learn more Okta and the CCPA Learn more Our Privacy Policy Read now Trust &amp;amp; Compliance Documentation Read now &amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&gt;\r\n&amp;lt;p&gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&gt;\r\n&amp;lt;p&gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&gt;\r\n&amp;lt;p&gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&gt;\r\n&amp;#34;}}&quot; id=&quot;text-6479cde534&quot; class=&quot;cmp-text rte-content&quot;&gt; To connect with a product expert today, email us or call +1-800-425-1267 . Contact us Okta on Youtube Okta on X Okta on LinkedIn Starting with Okta Okta Platform Auth0 Platform Pricing Free Trial Contact Sales Help &amp;amp; Support Help &amp;amp; Support Contact Us Okta Platform Status Auth0 Platform Status Legal Privacy Policy Site Terms Security Sitemap Cookie Preferences Your Privacy Choices United States { if (value) { $nextTick(() =&gt; $refs.footerItem1.focus()) } })&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;intl-menu-footer&quot;&gt; Australia Brazil Canada (EN) France Germany Japan Korea Mexico Netherlands Singapore Spain Sweden United Kingdom Copyright © 2025 Okta. All rights reserved.</code></pre>
